{
  "name": "dsh-integrated-desktop",
  "productName": "DSH Integrated",
  "version": "0.2.15",
  "description": "DSH 集成桌面端 —— 把官方 DeepSeek Harness 内核装进原生 Electron 外壳。外壳只负责窗口/托盘/原生体验与自有设置页，内核由外部独立管理，升级内核不需要动外壳。",
  "main": "src/main.js",
  "author": "陈黛华 / 18477514055 (https://github.com/18477514055)",
  "homepage": "https://github.com/18477514055/DSH-Integrated-Desktop",
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "git+https://github.com/18477514055/DSH-Integrated-Desktop.git"
  },
  "bugs": {
    "url": "https://github.com/18477514055/DSH-Integrated-Desktop/issues"
  },
  "license": "MIT",
  "private": true,
  "//extraResources": "★ 2026-09-25：随包分发 npm 本体（纯 JS，11.8 MB，零平台二进制）。用户因此不需要安装 Node.js —— 外壳用 Electron 自带的 Node 跑这个 npm，去替用户装 dsh 内核。见 scripts/fetch-npm.js 与 src/kernel-provision.js。**注意**：这不是插件（resources/plugins 仍然必须不存在，见 scripts/asar-check.js）。⚠️ 这条说明**必须放在这里，不能放进 build.extraResources 的对象里**：electron-builder 26 的 schema 是严格的，多一个 `_comment` 键会让 `npm run pack` 直接 exit 1（报 configuration.extraResources.0 should be one of these: string）—— 实测踩过。",
  "//electron": "★★ 版本**精确钉死，不许加 `^`，也不许「顺手升到最新」**（2026-09-25 实测）。原因：内核 0.1.6 起新增了运行时拦截，要 hook V8 内部去 require 内置模块，而它依赖的 node-addon-native-custom-loader 校验的是 **V8 运行时的精确指纹**，不是版本区间。实测只有 **43.0.0 / 44.0.0 / 45.0.0-alpha.6** 能跑 0.1.7 那一代内核；**Electron 44.4.5（当时的最新）与 37.10.3 都是 Unsupported/no-context**。所以升 Electron 之前先跑 node scripts/kernel-compat-check.js --version=<内核版本> --electron=<新 Electron 目录> 真启动一次。判据与证据：src/kernel-update.js 的 compatOf() / COMPAT_EVIDENCE / COMPAT_KNOWN_BAD_ELECTRON；护栏断言在 scripts/kernel-update-check.js 的 ②.6 段。",
  "scripts": {
    "start": "electron .",
    "dev": "electron . --dev",
    "smoke": "electron . --smoke",
    "icon": "electron scripts/make-icon.js",
    "verify:icon": "node scripts/verify-icon.js",
    "ensure:icon": "node scripts/ensure-icon.js",
    "fetch:npm": "node scripts/fetch-npm.js",
    "fetch:npm:check": "node scripts/fetch-npm.js --check",
    "pack": "node scripts/ensure-icon.js && node scripts/fetch-npm.js && electron-builder --win --dir",
    "dist": "node scripts/ensure-icon.js && node scripts/fetch-npm.js && electron-builder --win",
    "dist:portable": "node scripts/ensure-icon.js && node scripts/fetch-npm.js && electron-builder --win portable",
    "release:bundle": "node scripts/make-release-bundle.js",
    "release:check": "node scripts/make-release-bundle.js --check",
    "release:publish": "python scripts/publish-release.py",
    "pack:netdisk": "node scripts/make-netdisk-pack.js",
    "pack:netdisk:full": "node scripts/make-netdisk-pack.js --portable",
    "plugin:check": "node scripts/plugin-check.js",
    "plugin:check:archive": "node scripts/plugin-check-archive.js",
    "plugin:status": "node scripts/install-plugin.js --status",
    "plugin:install": "node scripts/install-plugin.js --apply",
    "plugin:revert": "node scripts/install-plugin.js --revert",
    "provision:check": "node scripts/provision-check.js",
    "quit:check": "node scripts/quit-check.js",
    "verify:asar": "node scripts/asar-check.js",
    "verify:packaged-npm": "node scripts/packaged-npm-check.js",
    "update:check": "node scripts/run-electron.js scripts/update-check.js",
    "kernel:check": "node scripts/run-electron.js scripts/kernel-update-check.js",
    "kernel:compat": "node scripts/kernel-compat-check.js",
    "kernel:provision:check": "node scripts/run-electron.js scripts/kernel-provision-check.js",
    "postinstall": "node scripts/check-kernel.js"
  },
  "devDependencies": {
    "electron": "44.0.0",
    "electron-builder": "^26.0.12"
  },
  "build": {
    "appId": "com.18477514055.dsh-integrated",
    "productName": "DSH Integrated",
    "copyright": "Copyright (c) 2026 陈黛华 / 18477514055。内嵌 DeepSeek Harness 内核版权归 DeepSeek 所有（MIT）。",
    "directories": {
      "output": "release",
      "buildResources": "assets"
    },
    "files": [
      "src/**/*",
      "assets/**/*",
      "!**/*.map",
      "!**/*.bak-*",
      "!runtime/**/*",
      "!migration/**/*",
      "!tools/**/*.ps1",
      "!**/node_modules/**/*"
    ],
    "extraResources": [
      {
        "from": "runtime/npm",
        "to": "npm",
        "filter": [
          "**/*",
          "!node_modules",
          "!node_modules/**/*"
        ]
      },
      {
        "from": "runtime/npm/node_modules",
        "to": "npm/node_modules",
        "filter": [
          "**/*"
        ]
      }
    ],
    "win": {
      "target": [
        {
          "target": "nsis",
          "arch": [
            "x64"
          ]
        },
        {
          "target": "portable",
          "arch": [
            "x64"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "icon": "assets/icon.ico",
      "artifactName": "DSH-Integrated-${version}-${arch}.${ext}"
    },
    "nsis": {
      "oneClick": false,
      "perMachine": false,
      "allowToChangeInstallationDirectory": true,
      "createDesktopShortcut": true,
      "createStartMenuShortcut": true,
      "shortcutName": "DSH Integrated",
      "deleteAppDataOnUninstall": false,
      "installerIcon": "assets/icon.ico",
      "uninstallerIcon": "assets/icon.ico"
    },
    "portable": {
      "artifactName": "DSH-Integrated-${version}-portable-${arch}.${ext}"
    }
  }
}
